      "writtenOn": "2020-10-15T18:42:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of packaging and managing the blobs, you can simply put the files in the \"distribution\" using the \"test_suites\" property in Soong rules.  Then you only need to either call getDevice().pushFile() from the local directory manually, or use `\u003ctarget_preparer class\u003d\"com.android.tradefed.targetprep.PushFilePreparer\"\u003e` in AndroidTest.xml.\n\nIf you need to get the local file path, you can use CompatibilityBuildHelper.getTestFile(...), which locates files in a \"test suites\" directory.",
